test.yaml:5:14: label "macos-14" is unknown. GitHub retired it on 2026-11-02, so a job on it never gets a runner. use "macos-15" or "macos-26" instead (https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/13518). if it is a custom label for self-hosted runner, set list of labels in jactionlint.yaml config file [runner-label]
test.yaml:9:14: label "macos-14-xlarge" is unknown. GitHub retired it on 2026-11-02, so a job on it never gets a runner. use "macos-15-xlarge" or "macos-26-xlarge" instead (https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/13518). if it is a custom label for self-hosted runner, set list of labels in jactionlint.yaml config file [runner-label]
